          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "evidence:anrufliste",
      "text": "The call log: 02:00 to 02:02 call with the doctor's surgery on the mainland, caller Frauke Jensen. 02:03 emergency call to the coastguard, caller Jasper Kühl, Süderhörn beacon gone dark. Both voices are recorded.",
